OL,3,ALabour mayors in England vow to cap
OL,4,Atourist tax at 5%
OL,5,
OL,6,FLabour's regional mayors in England
OL,7,Fhave pledged to cap a new fee on
OL,8,Fvisitors' overnight stays at 5%, after
OL,9,Fhospitality bosses warned it could put
OL,10,Fjobs at risk.
OL,12,FLocal leaders are set to gain new
OL,13,Fpowers to charge an uncapped levy,
OL,14,Fdubbed a "tourist tax", as a percentage
OL,15,Fof the cost of hotels, bed and
OL,16,Fbreakfasts and other types of
OL,17,Faccommodation.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
